        "node_id": "n_2_7a3eeb",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): Calculate the dot product for all pairs of vectors and use it to determine the cosine of the angle between them. Ensure to import the `math` module to access the `acos` function for calculating the angle.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
