        "node_id": "n_3_9dcef0",
        "thought_text": "Consider sorting the vectors based on their polar angles before grouping them into buckets. This approach ensures that vectors with similar orientations are adjacent, reducing the need for complex angle calculations and comparisons. Additionally, use a sliding window technique to efficiently find the pair of vectors with the minimal non-oriented angle among adjacent vectors.",
